# Built data artifacts. Globbed, not enumerated: the previous list named exactly
# `/packaged_dataset/` and `/splits_dataset/`, so the high-res variants
# (`packaged_dataset_hr/`, `splits_dataset_hr/`) were tracked by default -- 508 MB
# of Arrow, past GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit. All of it is reproducible
# from data_prep/ plus the Hub datasets, so none of it belongs in git.
/hf_dataset*/
/packaged_dataset*/
/splits_dataset*/
/baselines*.jsonl
/splits_manifest.json
*.arrow

# Source corpus: the Urdu Newspaper Benchmark (829 paragraph images, 9,982
# lines) from arXiv:2505.13943 -- 174 MB of third-party research data across
# 2,491 files. Not ours to redistribute, and the packaged form already lives on
# the Hub as rpant/ocr-corrector-ur{,-hr}. Provenance is documented in
# RL_review_v1.md section 3.3. Remove this line if you decide to vendor it.
/data/

